    {
      "source": "The Map implementation to use and the key to use for each column\nin the column Map can be customized through overriding\n<a href=\"#createColumnMap(int)\"><code>createColumnMap(int)</code></a> and <a href=\"#getColumnKey(java.lang.String)\"><code>getColumnKey(String)</code></a>, respectively.",
      "translation": "用于的 Map 实现以及列 Map 中每列所使用的键，可以通过分别重写<a href=\"#createColumnMap(int)\"><code>createColumnMap(int)</code></a>和<a href=\"#getColumnKey(java.lang.String)\"><code>getColumnKey(String)</code></a>来自定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation uses the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Readable.html#get-int-\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Readable.get(int)</code></a> method.",
      "translation": "默认实现使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Readable.html#get-int-\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Readable.get(int)</code></a> 方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<b>Note:</b> By default, ColumnMapRowMapper will try to build a linked Map\nwith case-insensitive keys, to preserve column order as well as allow any\ncasing to be used for column names. This requires Commons Collections on the\nclasspath (which will be autodetected). Else, the fallback is a standard linked\nHashMap, which will still preserve column order but requires the application\nto specify the column names in the same casing as exposed by the driver.",
      "translation": "<b>注意：</b> 默认情况下，ColumnMapRowMapper 将尝试构建一个具有不区分大小写键的链接 Map，以保留列顺序并允许使用任意大小写的列名。这需要在类路径中包含 Commons Collections（它将被自动检测）。否则，回退方案是标准的链接 HashMap，它仍将保留列顺序，但要求应用程序以与驱动程序暴露的大小写相同的格式指定列名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine the key to use for the given column in the column <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>.",
      "translation": "确定给定列在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>` 列中使用的键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A default <code>ColumnMapRowMapper</code> instance.",
      "translation": "默认 <code>ColumnMapRowMapper</code> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html#apply(T,U)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\">apply</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\">BiFunction</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Row.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\">Row</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/RowMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\">RowMetadata</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Map</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">String</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`apply` 在接口 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\">BiFunction</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Row.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\">Row</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/RowMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\">RowMetadata</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Map</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">String</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;&gt;</code> 中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>columnName</code> - the column name as returned by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Row.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Row</code></a>",
